","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":21,"created_at":"2026-02-17T17:02:09Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T09:49:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in: 4.6.0.stable, 4.6.1.stable\n- not reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot v4.6.1.stable - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750ti (Vulkan 1.4.309) \n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen opening a project configured to use the Vulkan renderer in Godot 4.6, my entire system freezes completely.\n\nThe freeze happens immediately after attempting to open the project. The editor window does not fully load, and the whole operating system becomes unresponsive. I cannot switch applications, open Task Manager, or close Godot. The only way to recover is to perform a hard reboot.\n\nThis does not happen with projects using the Compatibility (OpenGL) or DirectX 12 renderer. The issue seems to occur specifically when Vulkan is initialized.\n\nHardware:\n- GPU: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti\n- Vulkan version: 1.4.309\n- OS: Windows 10\n- Driver version: 582.28 (up-to-date)\n\nAdditional notes:\nI am not sure if this is a hardware limitation due to the age of the GPU.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open Godot 4.6.1\n- Open a project with Vulkan as Renderer drive in the Project Manager\n- My entire PC freeze, forcing a brute restart.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI dont have nothing, the issue dont allow me do any reproduction lol","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116414/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116414/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4511586275","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116414#issuecomment-4511586275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116414","id":4511586275,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDOlX4w","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/pr